1
00:00:14,760 --> 00:00:17,977
Since the game began, a
whole month has gone by.

2
00:00:18,060 --> 00:00:20,637
And 2,000 people have died so far.

3
00:00:20,720 --> 00:00:24,477
After all this time, none of the
players have been able to clear Floor 1.

4
00:00:24,560 --> 00:00:29,384
I used to be a beta tester, and even I
haven't found out where the boss's lair is.

5
00:00:32,740 --> 00:00:34,660
And today, finally,

6
00:00:35,020 --> 00:00:39,667
we're having a meeting to figure out how
to find and defeat the floor one boss.

7
00:00:59,320 --> 00:01:04,377
Miss ni koha Cait ta u,

8
00:01:04,460 --> 00:01:08,300
shiro no shibu kagejit wo ima ni.

9
00:01:11,080 --> 00:01:14,597
Utsus isu isu no

10
00:01:14,680 --> 00:01:18,577
sora wo Cait koko

11
00:01:18,660 --> 00:01:24,917
wa Cait hakanai koko wo Mito Sheyta.

12
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:29,577
I can't live in the heart.

13
00:01:29,660 --> 00:01:31,917
If your body is free.

14
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:35,697
I'm going to bring you up.

15
00:01:35,780 --> 00:01:38,577
I'm looking for short future.

16
00:01:38,660 --> 00:01:42,037
I'm about to spread out.

17
00:01:42,120 --> 00:01:43,532
I'm willing to feel you.

18
00:01:44,780 --> 00:01:46,857
I'm gonna be able to pray.

19
00:01:46,940 --> 00:01:48,437
To the light in your world.

20
00:01:48,520 --> 00:01:50,402
I've been to the strong witness.

21
00:02:17,280 --> 00:02:20,240
Okay, people, now that everyone's here?

22
00:02:20,400 --> 00:02:22,224
Let's get this meeting started.

23
00:02:23,420 --> 00:02:27,220
So anyway, I want to thank everyone
for coming. Good to see you.

24
00:02:27,400 --> 00:02:31,960
My name is Diabel, and in this
game, the job I rolled is night.

25
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:34,960
Dude, there's no job system in this game.

26
00:02:35,360 --> 00:02:37,360
You guys want to hear this or not?

27
00:02:39,920 --> 00:02:40,750
Right.

28
00:02:40,833 --> 00:02:42,172
Anyway, here's the deal.

29
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:45,809
Our party found the boss room
at the top of the tower today.

30
00:02:46,980 --> 00:02:50,451
First, we need to defeat the
boss and make it to floor two.

31
00:02:50,860 --> 00:02:52,100
The next step is,

32
00:02:52,300 --> 00:02:54,577
we have to tell everyone
waiting in the Town of

33
00:02:54,660 --> 00:02:57,542
Beginnings that it is
possible to beat this game.

34
00:02:57,920 --> 00:03:01,380
Fact is, it's our duty as the
most capable players here.

35
00:03:01,580 --> 00:03:03,400
Do you agree or not?

36
00:03:14,880 --> 00:03:17,437
Okay, glad to hear you're
all with me on this.

37
00:03:17,520 --> 00:03:20,317
Now, let's figure out how
we're gonna beat the boss.

38
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:23,280
First off, we'll team
up into parties of six.

39
00:03:24,560 --> 00:03:27,877
A typical party doesn't stand
a chance against a floor boss.

40
00:03:27,960 --> 00:03:30,737
We need a raid group made
up of multiple parties.

41
00:03:30,820 --> 00:03:31,650
Let's do this.

42
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:42,480
You got left out too, huh?

43
00:03:43,460 --> 00:03:44,300
Not even.

44
00:03:44,900 --> 00:03:46,140
I wasn't left out.

45
00:03:46,440 --> 00:03:49,517
It's just everyone seems
like they're already friends.

46
00:03:49,600 --> 00:03:51,137
So you're Solo, too.

47
00:03:51,220 --> 00:03:53,161
You want to form a party with me?

48
00:03:54,400 --> 00:03:55,997
You heard what the guy just said,

49
00:03:56,080 --> 00:04:00,256
we can't beat the boss on our own,
and it would only be for this fight.

50
00:04:16,500 --> 00:04:17,420
All right!

51
00:04:17,740 --> 00:04:20,480
Looks like everyone's teamed up. Now then!

52
00:04:20,580 --> 00:04:21,440
Hold up a sec!

53
00:04:29,520 --> 00:04:31,400
My name's Gabe. Got that?

54
00:04:31,700 --> 00:04:35,524
Before we take on the boss, I want
to get something off my chest.

55
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:39,477
We all know about the 2,000
people who've died so far, yeah?

56
00:04:39,560 --> 00:04:42,678
Well, some of you need to
apologize to him right now.

57
00:04:46,140 --> 00:04:48,846
Gabe, I think I know
who you're referring to.

58
00:04:49,100 --> 00:04:51,982
You mean the ones who are
ex-Beta testers, right?

59
00:04:52,860 --> 00:04:53,897
Of course I mean them.

60
00:04:53,980 --> 00:04:57,857
The day this stupid-ass game started, the
Beta guys just up and vanished, right?

61
00:04:57,940 --> 00:05:00,116
Right, they ditched all us beginners.

62
00:05:00,380 --> 00:05:04,797
They snagged all the good hunting spots,
and they grabbed all the easy quests too.

63
00:05:04,880 --> 00:05:07,377
They were the only ones
getting stronger in here.

64
00:05:07,460 --> 00:05:10,636
This whole time they've
ignored us like we're nothing.

65
00:05:11,240 --> 00:05:13,337
Hell, I bet there's some of them here.

66
00:05:13,420 --> 00:05:15,100
Come on out beta testers.

67
00:05:15,360 --> 00:05:17,540
We should make them apologize to us.

68
00:05:17,740 --> 00:05:20,977
And we should make them all give up
their money and the items they got.

69
00:05:21,060 --> 00:05:24,597
They can't expect the party to
trust them when they don't trust us.

70
00:05:24,680 --> 00:05:25,720
Why should we?

71
00:05:30,540 --> 00:05:31,716
Can I say something?

72
00:05:39,760 --> 00:05:42,060
Hey, my name's Egyu. Gabe, right?

73
00:05:42,360 --> 00:05:44,772
I want to make sure I'm on the same page.

74
00:05:44,960 --> 00:05:46,977
You say the ex-beta testers
should be blamed for

75
00:05:47,060 --> 00:05:49,217
the rookies' deaths because
they didn't help them.

76
00:05:49,300 --> 00:05:52,477
And you want them to apologize
and give up their winnings.

77
00:05:52,560 --> 00:05:53,795
I leave anything out?

78
00:05:53,920 --> 00:05:55,320
No, you didn't.

79
00:05:56,900 --> 00:06:03,417
the item store hands these out for free
it's a guidebook you got one didn't you sure

80
00:06:03,500 --> 00:06:09,200
i got one so what about it you know who
was handing these out the ex-beta testers

81
00:06:12,600 --> 00:06:15,297
listen up everyone had
equal access to this

82
00:06:15,380 --> 00:06:19,437
information even so lots
of players still died now i

83
00:06:19,520 --> 00:06:21,837
didn't come here to point
fingers at anyone i'm here

84
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:23,817
because i want to learn
from those player's deaths.

85
00:06:23,900 --> 00:06:27,959
I'm here because I want to find out
how we're going to beat the boss.

86
00:06:39,600 --> 00:06:40,430
Okay.

87
00:06:40,513 --> 00:06:42,139
Can we get back to the meeting now?

88
00:06:43,620 --> 00:06:46,440
For info on the boss, it's all in here.

89
00:06:46,660 --> 00:06:49,895
The latest issue of the
guidebook you just heard about.

90
00:06:50,620 --> 00:06:54,700
According to the book, the boss's
name is Illfang the Kobold Lord.

91
00:06:55,220 --> 00:06:59,220
Also, he'll be surrounded by his
minions, the Ruin Kobold Sentinels.

92
00:06:59,660 --> 00:07:01,920
Illfang carries an axe and a buckler.

93
00:07:02,520 --> 00:07:05,537
He has four health bars, and
when the last one turns red,

94
00:07:05,620 --> 00:07:09,160
he switches to a curved
sword-type weapon called a Talwar.

95
00:07:09,380 --> 00:07:11,851
He can change his patterns of attack, too.

96
00:07:18,740 --> 00:07:19,977
That's it for the briefing.

97
00:07:20,060 --> 00:07:25,277
As for the distribution of loot, money
will be divided equally among everyone.

98
00:07:25,360 --> 00:07:28,417
The party that defeats
the boss gets the XP,

99
00:07:28,500 --> 00:07:31,360
and whoever gets an item gets to keep it!

100
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:33,242
Any objections?

101
00:07:36,920 --> 00:07:37,750
Good!

102
00:07:38,080 --> 00:07:40,374
We leave tomorrow at 10 in the morning.

103
00:07:40,840 --> 00:07:42,369
Meeting adjourned, people!

104
00:08:18,500 --> 00:08:20,559
Those are pretty good, aren't they?

105
00:08:22,140 --> 00:08:23,340
Mind if I sit down?

106
00:08:35,300 --> 00:08:37,617
You really think these taste good, uh?

107
00:08:37,700 --> 00:08:42,917
—Huh, since I came to this town, I end
up eating at least one a day course.

108
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:44,677
I got a trick to make it taste better.

109
00:08:44,760 --> 00:08:46,077
What trick?

110
00:08:46,160 --> 00:08:49,860
Try it with some of that?

111
00:09:01,580 --> 00:09:02,410
Cream?

112
00:09:25,260 --> 00:09:27,740
I got it from the Heifer Strikes Back.

113
00:09:27,960 --> 00:09:30,917
That's the quest in the village
before you get to this one.

114
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:32,765
You want to know how I did it?

115
00:09:33,120 --> 00:09:33,950
Mama.

116
00:09:34,420 --> 00:09:38,820
I appreciate the offer, but I didn't
come to this town to eat good food.

117
00:09:39,460 --> 00:09:40,290
Okay.

118
00:09:40,373 --> 00:09:41,203
Why are you here?

119
00:09:42,440 --> 00:09:44,440
So I don't lose sight of who I am.

120
00:09:45,260 --> 00:09:49,797
I don't want to lock myself in a room in
the town of Beginnings and slowly rot away.

121
00:09:49,880 --> 00:09:52,821
I'd rather stay the way I
am till the last moment.

122
00:09:54,780 --> 00:10:01,220
Even if a monster beats me and I die, I
won't lose to this game or this world,

123
00:10:01,700 --> 00:10:02,800
no matter what.

124
00:10:08,300 --> 00:10:13,460
I wouldn't want a party member dying
on me, so try not to die tomorrow.

125
00:10:19,980 --> 00:10:21,360
Let's go over it again.

126
00:10:22,580 --> 00:10:23,580
We're the backup,

127
00:10:23,820 --> 00:10:28,137
so our target's gonna be the boss's
minions, the Rue and Kobold Sentinels.

128
00:10:28,220 --> 00:10:29,050
I know.

129
00:10:29,740 --> 00:10:33,377
I'll use a sword skill to knock
their weapons up and out of the way.

130
00:10:33,460 --> 00:10:35,640
When I do, switch and jump in.

131
00:10:36,580 --> 00:10:37,521
What's a switch?

132
00:10:38,560 --> 00:10:39,760
Okay, level with me.

133
00:10:39,980 --> 00:10:42,577
Is this the first time
you've ever been in a party?

134
00:10:42,660 --> 00:10:43,490
Uh-huh.

135
00:10:58,740 --> 00:10:59,916
Listen up, everyone.

136
00:11:00,360 --> 00:11:02,595
I've only got one thing to say to you.

137
00:11:03,100 --> 00:11:03,930
Let's win!

138
00:11:05,680 --> 00:11:06,510
Come on!

139
00:11:37,420 --> 00:11:39,340
Commence attack!

140
00:11:52,080 --> 00:11:53,880
Squads A and C, switch it!

141
00:11:55,580 --> 00:11:56,460
Here it comes!

142
00:11:56,720 --> 00:11:57,602
Squad B, block!

143
00:12:00,440 --> 00:12:03,087
Squad C, keep guarding
and prepare to switch.

144
00:12:03,320 --> 00:12:06,637
Everyone else, when you fall
back, regroup and flank them.

145
00:12:06,720 --> 00:12:10,620
Squads D, E, and F, keep those
minions off us! Yeah, you got it!

146
00:12:12,520 --> 00:12:13,350
Switch!

147
00:12:14,100 --> 00:12:14,930
I'm on it!

148
00:12:15,840 --> 00:12:19,097
I thought she was a beginner,
but she's got good skills.

149
00:12:19,180 --> 00:12:21,640
I can't even see the tip of her sword.

150
00:12:26,800 --> 00:12:27,680
Right on.

151
00:12:44,580 --> 00:12:47,900
Looks like the guidebook
was right. Stand back!

152
00:12:48,700 --> 00:12:49,560
I got it!

153
00:12:51,540 --> 00:12:55,305
I thought the plan was for everyone
in the group to surround it.

154
00:13:06,040 --> 00:13:07,216
That's not a Talwar!

155
00:13:07,360 --> 00:13:08,340
It's a Nodachi!

156
00:13:08,620 --> 00:13:10,091
This isn't like the Beta!

157
00:13:12,240 --> 00:13:13,070
Wait, stop!

158
00:13:13,153 --> 00:13:15,020
It's no good! Get out of there!

159
00:13:24,500 --> 00:13:25,720
Diabel, no!

160
00:13:30,400 --> 00:13:31,230
Diabel!

161
00:13:35,160 --> 00:13:37,042
What the hell were you thinking?

162
00:13:40,460 --> 00:13:45,140
You know, you were a beta
tester too, weren't you?

163
00:13:48,720 --> 00:13:52,280
You were after the last
attack bonus, the rare item.

164
00:13:52,720 --> 00:13:55,420
You're just like me, a beta tester.

165
00:14:01,240 --> 00:14:03,717
Please, you have to...

166
00:14:03,800 --> 00:14:05,880
defeat the boss...

167
00:14:07,840 --> 00:14:09,600
for everyone here.

168
00:14:15,020 --> 00:14:16,837
When this death game started,

169
00:14:16,920 --> 00:14:20,457
the only thing I thought about
was how I was gonna survive.

170
00:14:20,540 --> 00:14:22,117
Nothing else mattered.

171
00:14:22,200 --> 00:14:26,180
Take care, I'll be seeing you, Klein.

172
00:14:27,640 --> 00:14:31,897
But you weren't like that, diabel—you
never abandoned the other players.

173
00:14:31,980 --> 00:14:36,857
You brought them together, you led
everyone and you fought brilliantly.

174
00:14:36,940 --> 00:14:40,900
brilliantly You tried to
accomplish something I couldn't.

175
00:14:49,800 --> 00:14:50,860
I'll go, too.

176
00:14:51,760 --> 00:14:52,590
Okay.

177
00:14:55,640 --> 00:14:58,117
We'll hit him just like
we did the minions.

178
00:14:58,200 --> 00:14:59,120
You got it.

179
00:15:07,580 --> 00:15:08,860
Switch!

180
00:15:11,820 --> 00:15:12,650
Asuna!

181
00:15:30,520 --> 00:15:33,740
She's coming back!

182
00:15:39,100 --> 00:15:40,580
Uh… Uh…

183
00:15:42,740 --> 00:15:43,840
Ah!

184
00:15:45,080 --> 00:15:45,910
No!

185
00:15:46,880 --> 00:15:47,800
No!

186
00:16:08,420 --> 00:16:11,773
We can hold this bastard off
until your health's back up.

187
00:16:11,900 --> 00:16:13,040
You got it.

188
00:16:23,520 --> 00:16:24,500
Watch out!

189
00:16:28,120 --> 00:16:29,620
You're going down!

190
00:16:34,320 --> 00:16:35,457
Come on, Asuna!

191
00:16:35,540 --> 00:16:37,060
Help me beat this sucker!

192
00:16:37,280 --> 00:16:39,380
One last attack! You got it!

193
00:17:15,040 --> 00:17:18,400
What are you talking about?

194
00:17:18,940 --> 00:17:19,980
Come on, baby!

195
00:17:21,060 --> 00:17:21,890
Yes!

196
00:17:22,420 --> 00:17:23,250
Come on!

197
00:17:23,333 --> 00:17:25,241
We ain't gonna put nothing on us!

198
00:17:35,540 --> 00:17:36,370
Nice job.

199
00:17:36,980 --> 00:17:38,677
That was some fine swordsmanship.

200
00:17:38,760 --> 00:17:39,701
Congratulations.

201
00:17:39,900 --> 00:17:42,100
Today's victory is all thanks to you.

202
00:17:42,680 --> 00:17:43,510
No.

203
00:17:53,680 --> 00:17:54,900
Stop cheering!

204
00:17:57,400 --> 00:17:58,680
Why'd you do it, huh?

205
00:17:59,900 --> 00:18:01,760
Why'd you let Diabel die?

206
00:18:02,960 --> 00:18:04,040
Let him die?

207
00:18:05,260 --> 00:18:07,360
That's what I said. Admit it.

208
00:18:07,500 --> 00:18:10,017
You knew the technique
the boss was going to use.

209
00:18:10,100 --> 00:18:11,460
You could have told us.

210
00:18:11,720 --> 00:18:13,857
Then Taboo would have stood a chance.

211
00:18:13,940 --> 00:18:15,587
He wouldn't have had to die.

212
00:18:21,740 --> 00:18:22,880
I know why he knew.

213
00:18:23,060 --> 00:18:24,707
He used to be a beta tester.

214
00:18:24,820 --> 00:18:25,650
Think about it.

215
00:18:25,733 --> 00:18:27,257
He knew the boss's attack patterns.

216
00:18:27,340 --> 00:18:29,560
He knew, but he kept it from us.

217
00:18:31,020 --> 00:18:34,040
And I bet he's not the
only beta tester here.

218
00:18:34,320 --> 00:18:35,791
Come on, show yourselves!

219
00:18:50,140 --> 00:18:55,540
This is bad at this
rate for everyone here.

220
00:18:59,580 --> 00:19:00,410
Oh.

221
00:19:04,500 --> 00:19:06,020
Hey, calm down.

222
00:19:16,480 --> 00:19:19,360
So you guys think I used
to be a beta tester?

223
00:19:20,800 --> 00:19:24,271
It's not cool to put me in the
same class with those noobs!

224
00:19:25,420 --> 00:19:26,360
What'd you say?

225
00:19:27,600 --> 00:19:28,600
You heard me.

226
00:19:28,940 --> 00:19:33,197
Most of the thousand people who scored
a slot in SAO's beta were rookies.

227
00:19:33,280 --> 00:19:36,692
They were so green, they didn't
even know how to level up.

228
00:19:37,120 --> 00:19:39,826
Hell, even you guys are
better than they were.

229
00:19:42,300 --> 00:19:45,240
But me, I'm nothing like those guys, man.

230
00:19:47,760 --> 00:19:52,037
During the beta, I made it to floors that
were higher than any of the other testers.

231
00:19:52,120 --> 00:19:53,200
That's a fact.

232
00:19:53,380 --> 00:19:54,880
I knew about the boss,

233
00:19:55,020 --> 00:19:59,608
because I fought tons of monsters with
way more sword skills on higher floors.

234
00:20:00,760 --> 00:20:02,878
I know a bunch of other things, too.

235
00:20:03,140 --> 00:20:04,669
More than you can imagine.

236
00:20:04,900 --> 00:20:06,640
More than any info broker.

237
00:20:08,160 --> 00:20:09,380
What the hell?

238
00:20:09,880 --> 00:20:12,817
If that's true, then you're
worse than a beta tester.

239
00:20:12,900 --> 00:20:14,500
You're a goddamn cheater!

240
00:20:14,640 --> 00:20:15,816
That's what you are!

241
00:20:16,720 --> 00:20:18,740
He's a beta tester and a cheater!

242
00:20:18,980 --> 00:20:19,860
He's a beater!

243
00:20:21,020 --> 00:20:22,060
A beater?

244
00:20:22,380 --> 00:20:24,480
Yeah, that's good. I like it.

245
00:20:25,300 --> 00:20:26,130
Okay.

246
00:20:26,560 --> 00:20:28,100
You can call me a beater.

247
00:20:28,400 --> 00:20:32,400
Just make sure you don't confuse
me with those beta testers anymore.

248
00:20:51,080 --> 00:20:51,910
Wait!

249
00:20:55,180 --> 00:20:58,517
When we were fighting the
boss, you called me by my name.

250
00:20:58,600 --> 00:21:00,200
I wasn't trying to be rude.

251
00:21:01,040 --> 00:21:02,922
Did I mess up the pronunciation?

252
00:21:03,680 --> 00:21:05,033
How'd you even know it?

253
00:21:05,860 --> 00:21:10,120
If you look right about here, you'll
see another HP gauge under yours.

254
00:21:10,520 --> 00:21:13,226
There's a name written
right next to it, yeah?

255
00:21:17,020 --> 00:21:17,850
Kirito.

256
00:21:18,540 --> 00:21:19,370
Kirito?

